# Conventions

- All prompts in `cookiecutter.json`; `hooks/post_gen_project.py` only deletes + asserts, never generates.
- No literal double-open-brace in hooks outside real `cookiecutter.*` variables (the hook file is itself Jinja-rendered — build the sequence from `chr(123)`).
- Every template variable must render; post-gen hook fails generation on leftovers.
- `AGENTS.md` canonical; `CLAUDE.md` pointer; Copilot/Cursor condensations must mention `make check`.
- Mirror Makefile/lint-set changes into the templated `AGENTS.md`.
